stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> requested
  requested --> ownership_pending: reserve unique hostname
  ownership_pending --> tls_pending: ownership validated
  ownership_pending --> failed: bad or expired verification
  tls_pending --> dns_pending: Cloudflare SSL active
  dns_pending --> active: DNS points to target + both statuses active
  dns_pending --> failed: timeout / invalid DNS
  failed --> ownership_pending: authorized retry
  active --> suspended: operator or abuse action
  suspended --> active: revalidate and authorize
  active --> releasing: customer removal request
  suspended --> releasing: owner removes
  releasing --> released: revoke mapping then delete provider hostname
  released --> [*]
